a. $\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=0.8\\\theta&=\tan^{-1}(0.8)\\&\approx39^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

b. The calculator returns a negative angle. Add $180^{\circ}$ before rounding.

$\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=-1.2\\\theta&=\tan^{-1}(-1.2)+180^{\circ}\\&\approx130^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

