\draw[<->,mathblue,thick] (-1.7,2.04)--(1.7,-2.04);
\draw[->,black] (0.7,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=129.8056,radius=0.7];
\path (65:1.15) node {$\theta\approx130^{\circ}$};
\path (1.4,1.65) node {$m=-1.2$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}m&=\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\&=\dfrac{-3-1}{4-0}\\&=-1\end{aligned}$

The inverse tangent is negative, so add $180^{\circ}$.

$\begin{aligned}\theta&=\tan^{-1}(-1)+180^{\circ}\\&=-45^{\circ}+180^{\circ}\\&=135^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

